# Instacart Data Analysis Project

Project Overview
This project explores the Instacart Online Grocery Shopping Dataset using Python and Pandas.

## Objectives
- Analyze customer shopping behavior
- Identify the most popular products
- Explore reorder patterns
- Analyze shopping by hour and day
- Calculate reorder proportions

### Tools
- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Google Colab

### Files
- Instacart_Project.ipynb
- README.md

### Key Findings
- Most orders are placed during the daytime.
- Popular products are reordered frequently.
- Most customers purchase a relatively small number of items per order.
- Reorders represent a significant portion of customer purchases.
